<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team regarding your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_Airport__c}}}.
<p><strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We want all our customers to have a comfortable and enjoyable journey when they travel with us, so I was sorry to hear that you were affected by the poor behaviour of <em><strong>&lt;nearby children/another passenger&gt;</strong></em>.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If due to noisy children add</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to your comfort</strong><br />
<br />
To make sure parents feel supported and comfortable inflight, we offer children's packs and meals as well as bassinets for babies.<br />
<br />
While I understand how frustrating the situation was for you, we do rely on parents to ensure that their children don’t disturb other passengers, and our crew have to be sensitive in dealing with this type of situation.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If questioning outcome for disruptive customer add</strong></em><br />
<br />
While I’m sure you’re keen to know the result of your feedback, I'm unable to advise you of the outcome due to privacy regulations.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>